   Molnar, Zsolt; Bede-Fazekas, Akos, Ctr Ecol Res, Inst Ecol \& Bot, Vacratot, Hungary.
   Molnar, Zsolt; Bede-Fazekas, Akos; Bir, Marianna, Ctr Ecol Res, GINOP Sustainable Ecosyst Grp, Tihany, Hungary.},
