   Wangsness, Paal Brevik; Rodseth, Kenneth Lovold, Norwegian Ctr Transport Res, Inst Transport Econ, Gaustadaleen 21, N-0349 Oslo, Norway.
   Proost, Stef, KULeuven, Dept Econ, Naamse Str 69, B-3000 Leuven, Belgium.
   Wangsness, Paal Brevik, Norwegian Univ Life Sci, Sch Econ \& Business, As, Norway.},
